<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Concor builds year earnings, div.</title>
<headline>Concor builds year earnings, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     216.7	 vs 179.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 60.0	  vs 52.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   25.17	 vs 20.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   33.36	 vs 29.94</p>
<p>    Tax			 8.32	  vs 9.64</p>
<p>    Interest received     6.77	  vs 8.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		  875.59	vs 729.16</p>
<p>Div payable end-October</p>
<p>on register September 27</p>
<p>Full name: Concor Ltd (building and construction)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
